      en: ["The Throne Hall was completed in 1917 under the orders of King Sisowath.", "The Silver Pagoda houses a life-sized Buddha made of solid gold.", "The walls of the compound are painted with frescoes from the Reamker epic.", "The floor of the Silver Pagoda consists of 5,329 individual silver tiles.", "The palace faces the confluence of the Mekong and Tonle Sap rivers.", "Visitors must adhere to strict dress codes (covered knees and shoulders)."],
