      en: ["Built in the 11th century during the reign of Suryavarman I.", "Located about 13 kilometers north of the city of Battambang.", "Originally dedicated as a Hindu temple to the god Shiva.", "The enclosure wall measures approximately 52 by 49 meters.", "Features intricate lintels depicting the Churning of the Ocean of Milk.", "Home to a modern 28-meter-high Buddha statue added recently."],
